{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ProximaB</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A short &quot;Sci-Fi&quot; adventure game made for the Game Boy Color in GB Studio! Solve puzzles, collect energy for your weapons, and fight the alien Ackloids to claim the planet Proxima B for the humans!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puzzle-based level progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique enemies and creatures</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 levels, each with unique bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full 8-bit soundtrack and art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Player color customizer</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Story</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718720/extras/pixil-frame-0__72_.png?t=1746824482\" /><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Earth is in ruins after a large asteroid hit it about 10 years ago. You sign up to be an &quot;IASA&quot;  combat astronaut to help fix your home world as well as find a new one. You were assigned to help survey the land and &quot;tame&quot; the planet for human colonization. But disaster strikes when you  and your co-pilot, Xelendra (Xel), land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718720/extras/pixil-frame-0__73_.png?t=1746824482\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Another alien race (&quot;The Ackloids&quot;) is attempting to colonize the planet for themselves, and they aren't up for any negotiations. With an attack on the human command ship, the only other human who can help is an injured Xel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you have what it takes to defeat the Ackloids and save the human race? Find out in:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718720/extras/proxima-logo.png?t=1746824482\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve puzzles with buttons, your energy weapons, and creatures to open doors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718720/extras/puzzels.gif?t=1746824482\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find hidden rooms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718720/extras/secret-resized.gif?t=1746824482\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect upgrades for your weapons and reach the Ackloid command ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718720/extras/upgrade.gif?t=1746824482\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>*The gameplay images shown are pre-production content and are subject to change.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3718720?t=1746824482","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718720/e6651a9dc8cd51a38eeab1b436d4b0570e924bd2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746824482","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718720/5f9a5cab770fca1c1eeb9ecdce15b027485ba668/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746824482","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718720/5f9a5cab770fca1c1eeb9ecdce15b027485ba668/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746824482","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ProximaB</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A short &quot;Sci-Fi&quot; adventure game made for the Game Boy Color in GB Studio! Solve puzzles, collect energy for your weapons, and fight the alien Ackloids to claim the planet Proxima B for the humans!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puzzle-based level progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique enemies and creatures</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 levels, each with unique bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full 8-bit soundtrack and art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Player color customizer</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Story</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718720/extras/pixil-frame-0__72_.png?t=1746824482\" /><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Earth is in ruins after a large asteroid hit it about 10 years ago. You sign up to be an &quot;IASA&quot;  combat astronaut to help fix your home world as well as find a new one. You were assigned to help survey the land and &quot;tame&quot; the planet for human colonization. But disaster strikes when you  and your co-pilot, Xelendra (Xel), land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718720/extras/pixil-frame-0__73_.png?t=1746824482\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Another alien race (&quot;The Ackloids&quot;) is attempting to colonize the planet for themselves, and they aren't up for any negotiations. With an attack on the human command ship, the only other human who can help is an injured Xel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you have what it takes to defeat the Ackloids and save the human race? Find out in:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718720/extras/proxima-logo.png?t=1746824482\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve puzzles with buttons, your energy weapons, and creatures to open doors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718720/extras/puzzels.gif?t=1746824482\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find hidden rooms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718720/extras/secret-resized.gif?t=1746824482\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect upgrades for your weapons and reach the Ackloid command ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718720/extras/upgrade.gif?t=1746824482\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>*The gameplay images shown are pre-production content and are subject to change.</i></p>","developers":["Zap Coders"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718720/9f9f86cd1abc67a787d5fce6817f3b387938c9a7/header.jpg?t=1746824482","is_free":false,"linux